<mxCell id="leg" value="&lt;b&gt;Core idea:&lt;/b&gt; only &lt;b&gt;public&lt;/b&gt; keys travel (age1… / ssh-ed25519 / github:USER). Private keys and the plaintext master key never leave each machine. The remote holds only ciphertext plus the master key wrapped per person. Without &lt;code&gt;kis unlock&lt;/code&gt;, a clone only sees ciphertext." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#999999;dashed=1;fontSize=11;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=8;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20" y="630" width="1140" height="70" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
</root></mxGraphModel></diagram>
