<mxCell id="o6" value='&lt;b&gt;"ci" is just a name&lt;/b&gt; (could be deploy,&lt;br&gt;codex-bot…). --new-key is what changes&lt;br&gt;the behaviour.' style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#999999;dashed=1;fontSize=11;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=8;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="560" width="380" height="80" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
